Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.66,0:00:06.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is Trigun.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.66,0:00:33.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,guitar solo
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.02,0:01:38.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Typhoon is currently\Ngaining strength and will be
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.76,0:01:41.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,passing approximately 30\Nmiles away from New Oregon.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.86,0:01:44.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The gale is expected\Nto last until morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.22,0:01:48.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please be advised that high wind warnings\Nare still in effect until further night.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.42,0:01:49.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So this is a Typhoon.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.28,0:01:52.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've heard that one can be strong,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.12,0:01:55.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I never dreamed it could\Nblow with this kind of force.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.16,0:01:56.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.30,0:01:59.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In fact, this one is so huffy,\Nshe must be related to...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.14,0:02:00.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mr. Vash!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.52,0:02:03.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Her name is Jacqueline, and...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.04,0:02:07.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.95,0:02:09.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Vash, excuse me, but\Nmay we have a moment...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.88,0:02:11.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to speak with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.18,0:02:20.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please don't look for me, Vash.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.92,0:02:22.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn, he got us!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.24,0:02:25.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Either he's incredibly slippery, or he's\Njust gone completely out of his mind!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.72,0:02:27.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't believe he'd actually\Ngo out in these conditions!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.90,0:02:29.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No problem, we'll find it. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.84,0:02:34.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I suspected he might try this, so when I\Nbrought him breakfast earlier this morning,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.84,0:02:37.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I slipped one of these\Ninto the food on his plate.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.76,0:02:38.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, my gosh.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.92,0:02:40.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's a transmitting device.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.24,0:02:42.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm amazed the company let\Nyou have something like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.00,0:02:46.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Since I'm always messing up, the chief\Ngave it to me as a going-away present.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.20,0:02:48.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He says it'll keep anyone\Nfrom outwitting me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.10,0:02:52.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Millie, I hate to tell you, but\Nthat's nothing to brag about.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.70,0:02:56.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look, look, he's really close by.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.90,0:02:59.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're catching up already!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.52,0:03:03.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah! Warmer! Warmer! Warmer!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.60,0:03:08.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh my god!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.02,0:03:11.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He changed into a cat this time! Millie!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.48,0:03:32.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Vash.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.20,0:03:36.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Vash!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.32,0:03:39.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, Vash.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.62,0:03:40.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stand up already.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.06,0:03:42.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.84,0:03:45.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.50,0:03:47.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't be that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.80,0:03:49.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's just you and me here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.34,0:03:51.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We should at least try\Nto act like brothers.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.84,0:03:57.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Murderer!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.94,0:03:59.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your whole life is a lie!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.54,0:04:01.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You killed Rem! The crew!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.86,0:04:03.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You killed them all!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.24,0:04:07.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, spectacular, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.32,0:04:09.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They all die.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.98,0:04:10.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Except, of course,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.98,0:04:15.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,for the fraction who will survive\Nbecause of Rem's incessant meddling.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.48,0:04:17.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Knives?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.62,0:04:19.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.53,0:04:21.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You aren't even human!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.92,0:04:23.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn straight I'm not!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.10,0:04:27.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How dare you call me\Nthose damn perfect things!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.84,0:04:28.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How dare you!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.38,0:04:31.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Never compare me to that!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.28,0:04:36.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're nothing but garbage.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.94,0:04:38.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will kill you all.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.92,0:04:42.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Only we will be left on this planet.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.14,0:04:44.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rem!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.60,0:04:47.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, Vash, take care of Noss!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.18,0:04:56.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know what I have to do, Rem.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.36,0:04:58.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't wait any longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.90,0:05:00.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's time to face him.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.46,0:05:01.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to be ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.98,0:05:06.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jacqueline's ankle should\Npass near the Craggy Bluff,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.86,0:05:10.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,blowing to the southeast\Nat exactly 1.22 p .m.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.42,0:05:12.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm counting on you, old chum.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.10,0:05:19.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you're wrong about this, you crazy\Nold geezer, I'll haunt you to the grave!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.98,0:05:32.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I still feel like I'm having a freaking\Nheart attack every time I do this!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.20,0:05:34.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This thing's going ba-da-boom ba-da-boom!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.24,0:05:36.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought you were committing suicide!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.76,0:05:37.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Suicide?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.67,0:05:39.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I strongly disapprove of\Nsuicide, it's just a...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.88,0:05:40.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.94,0:05:42.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wolfwood?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.85,0:05:43.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.30,0:05:47.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,First you're crying your eyes\Nout like an abandoned baby,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.22,0:05:49.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and then you're running\Naround jumping off cliffs.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.36,0:05:51.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell's the\Nmatter with you anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.08,0:05:52.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm visiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.34,0:05:55.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Say what?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.66,0:05:57.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm visiting the folks.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.56,0:06:00.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, right. What do they have?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.14,0:06:01.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A summer cottage in the sky?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.56,0:06:03.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm really getting sick of your lies.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.08,0:06:08.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.99,0:06:10.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, what the hell's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.42,0:06:11.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just what it looks like.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.14,0:06:15.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a ship that didn't\Nquite crash 130 years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.54,0:06:16.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is unbelievable.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.96,0:06:22.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who'd have known that the lost\Ntechnology was still preserved like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.34,0:06:25.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, did you say you're\Nvisiting your folks?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.12,0:06:28.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Does that mean people are\Nactually living up here?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.02,0:06:33.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think that you'll be their first\Nhouse guest to visit in over 20 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.92,0:06:48.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.83,0:06:51.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Legato, it has happened as expected.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.60,0:06:53.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He has made his move.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.78,0:07:00.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Also, Vash the Stampede appears to\Nbe working with the Minister Clan.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.46,0:07:05.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I suspect this man is...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.18,0:07:06.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Never mind him.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.34,0:07:09.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your task will remain the\Nsame no matter who he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.52,0:07:11.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, Master.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.48,0:07:15.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're such a fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.40,0:07:19.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Had you behaved, you might\Nhave lived to see Doomsday.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.82,0:07:22.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I must say, I am pleased.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.08,0:07:27.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For now, I have an opportunity to\Nfulfill another of my master's wishes.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.70,0:07:39.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Doctor, you won't believe this!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.32,0:07:43.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,are you going to tell me that\Nsomeone is here from the outside?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.16,0:07:46.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, yeah. It's him. He's back.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.42,0:07:49.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, Brad, have you ever met him before?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.90,0:07:53.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, yeah, I have, but I\Nwas just a kid back then.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.30,0:07:56.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This will be the first time\Nyou've met a real legend.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.40,0:07:57.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's changed over the years.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.04,0:07:59.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.18,0:08:05.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So he really is back, what do you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.68,0:08:10.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Amazing how many years has it been\Nsince I last opened this door?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.36,0:08:21.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is he there? Is that him?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.40,0:08:27.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.31,0:08:28.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're telling me now I can't come in?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.70,0:08:31.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who do you think you are,\Nyou needle-logging idiot?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.18,0:08:32.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ow!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.09,0:08:32.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, hey, Doc.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.52,0:08:35.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that your great legend?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.40,0:08:36.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that Vash, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.50,0:08:38.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a relief.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.68,0:08:40.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He hasn't changed at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.50,0:08:48.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your name's Brad, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.08,0:08:49.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Man, you sure got taller.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.34,0:08:51.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.30,0:08:52.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,By the way, who's he?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.62,0:08:56.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know, to tell you the\Ntruth, I'm not really sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.20,0:08:57.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.11,0:09:00.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't mind you wandering around the\Nplace, but outsiders are not welcome here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.64,0:09:02.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, then I'll be like that big guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.74,0:09:04.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.58,0:09:13.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't stare. Come on inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.04,0:09:17.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get used to it. You win. I'll behave.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.88,0:09:18.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh? Vash!!!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.79,0:09:19.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.96,0:09:29.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.05,0:09:30.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.97,0:09:32.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gee, this is all rather\Nsudden, young lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.92,0:09:37.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I may have a reputation of being easy,\Nbut even I need a bit of advanced warning.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.08,0:09:44.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jessica! That's right! Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.68,0:09:46.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't believe you remembered me!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.20,0:09:48.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is the best date ever!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.60,0:09:53.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, Vash, this must\Nbe your girlfriend, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.06,0:09:55.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You are one lucky devil.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.84,0:09:58.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.96,0:10:00.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did I embarrass you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.48,0:10:07.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry, but I have to speak with\Nthe doctor for a little while.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.16,0:10:07.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.07,0:10:09.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now that's not fair! Jessica!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.50,0:10:12.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come see me after, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.04,0:10:14.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Like right after?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.22,0:10:15.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll hate you if you don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.20,0:10:17.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,OK, all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.04,0:10:19.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be back in a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.28,0:10:22.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, Vash, how's Max? Is he well?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.84,0:10:24.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah, he's doing great.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.42,0:10:26.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He has staring contests\Nwith forecast charts.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.94,0:10:27.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.02,0:10:31.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm, well, now, I haven't\Nintroduced myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.54,0:10:32.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My name is Wolf Wa -
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.30,0:10:35.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can you blame her?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.50,0:10:37.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The people who live on\Nthis ship aren't about
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.26,0:10:39.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to trust a bunch of\Noutsiders bringing in war?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.36,0:10:40.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and violence.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.76,0:10:43.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You make this place stink like gunpowder.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.84,0:10:45.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stay put until he gets back.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.46,0:10:47.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't want any trouble. Got that?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.68,0:10:53.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You could at least offer\Nme a drink or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.86,0:10:58.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For crying out loud, I am not the\Nleast bit happy about this Millie.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.34,0:10:59.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have just found him again,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.58,0:11:01.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and then we let him slip right\Nout from under our noses.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.60,0:11:03.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know all that, but\Nwe can't go out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.68,0:11:04.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's too dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.86,0:11:07.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have to, and besides,\Ndanger is part of the job.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.34,0:11:51.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,An entire city is surrounded\Nby lost technology.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.14,0:11:55.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm saying it to you little\Nby little, needle noggin.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.42,0:11:59.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get out of here, mister!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.46,0:12:02.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry, but he's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.94,0:12:06.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hate to say it, but I\Nfeel the same way he does.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.50,0:12:08.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm begging you for the good of all of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.52,0:12:09.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please leave this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.20,0:12:16.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why, so you can all just carry on with\Nyour perfect cozy little shuffle of lives?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.92,0:12:17.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.83,0:12:20.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You need to realize your\Nplants are not inexhaustible.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.32,0:12:22.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They could very easily\Nbreak down some day.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.16,0:12:24.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't cling on to them forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.76,0:12:26.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This technology has a finite lifespan.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.88,0:12:27.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you telling us?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.04,0:12:30.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have no idea how hard it\Nis to maintain these systems.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.90,0:12:33.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're not planning on anything\Nshutting down for a long time now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.76,0:12:35.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And anything's better\Nthan living out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.58,0:12:37.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've heard that people's\Nlives are meaningless to you,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.72,0:12:39.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so why should we listen to\Nanything you have to say?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.82,0:12:40.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.88,0:12:46.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No matter what you say, it's\Nnot gonna change anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.38,0:12:48.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You better get used to\Nthe idea that someday
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.70,0:12:51.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you're gonna all live\Non that desert planet.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.88,0:12:55.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anything new happen while I was away?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.02,0:12:57.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, not much.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.50,0:13:00.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're still sleeping\Nin suspended animation.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.24,0:13:01.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.15,0:13:02.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We were all worried sick.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.30,0:13:06.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've been out of touch\Nfor nearly five years.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.48,0:13:07.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.02,0:13:08.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.93,0:13:09.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Like you even care.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.85,0:13:13.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Five years is probably nothing more\Nthan the blink of an eye for you anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.50,0:13:14.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's enough, Brad.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.41,0:13:16.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Vash is not that kind of person.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.64,0:13:18.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Person?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.55,0:13:19.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You gotta be kidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.64,0:13:24.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Since you have returned, I suppose\Nthat means it's not over yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.20,0:13:29.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you come into contact with him\Nduring the fifth moon incident?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.50,0:13:32.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not directly, but my guess would be\Nthat he had something to do with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.00,0:13:37.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have absolutely no memory of it happening,\Njust like the time before in July.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.66,0:13:38.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell me, Vash.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.76,0:13:40.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you fire it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.54,0:13:43.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Mr. Legend!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.88,0:13:45.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Since you're the one that\Nfired off the big weapon,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.04,0:13:47.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,doesn't that make you more\Ndestructive than knives?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.64,0:13:48.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I said enough, Brad!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.14,0:13:50.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, doesn't it? Brad!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.54,0:13:53.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.45,0:13:54.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I suppose it does.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.64,0:13:55.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That is not funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.10,0:13:57.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That is not funny!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.46,0:14:00.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the whole damn world\Nwe're talking about here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.26,0:14:02.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you think I am aware of that?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.44,0:14:03.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,However,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.35,0:14:06.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the only one who has been able\Nto oppose knives fight off his
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.32,0:14:10.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,demons and survive them is that\Ngentleman holding by the neck?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.78,0:14:13.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm asking you to please trust me!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.88,0:14:16.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.54,0:14:26.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.48,0:14:28.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.39,0:14:29.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't blame him.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.34,0:14:33.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Too simple and ordinary people,\NI must seem like a monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.96,0:14:35.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, that's half his problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.98,0:14:40.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's hopelessly in love with Jessica,\Nand he just told her for the first time.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.64,0:14:42.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jessica.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.88,0:14:45.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Brad, but\NI'm going to marry back.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.48,0:14:50.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm getting very fast! Fast! Fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.12,0:14:53.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, that's the other\Nhalf of Brad's problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.82,0:14:55.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's in there?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.70,0:15:02.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A little something you might be needing.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.22,0:15:12.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He hasn't been much fun,\Nbut I'm sure glad he's back.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.58,0:15:14.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At least he hasn't changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.28,0:15:15.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He hasn't changed a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.52,0:15:17.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Matt!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.44,0:15:19.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.38,0:15:20.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.08,0:15:29.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look at me! Look at me! I'm in love!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.64,0:15:38.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This damn ship is full of nothing\Nbut rotten, ignorant people.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.20,0:15:41.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Doesn't anyone trust the\Nword of a priest anymore?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.06,0:15:44.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, up and up in there!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.46,0:15:50.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's going on? What's wrong?\NWhat the hell's going on in there?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.46,0:16:17.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, it was exactly\Nlike this when I got here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.90,0:16:21.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, listen to me! What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.50,0:16:24.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Brad, it's Terry and Natasha.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.82,0:16:35.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was me, Brad.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.28,0:16:42.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm asking you to please trust me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.50,0:16:47.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no way you can\Nprove your innocence!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.82,0:16:49.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is great, Doc.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.20,0:16:50.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's by far the smoothest one yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.82,0:16:51.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm glad you like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.86,0:16:52.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, we'd better hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.82,0:16:54.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's gotten very late.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.14,0:16:56.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jessica will be furious with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.90,0:16:59.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.81,0:17:01.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She said she would be here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.40,0:17:04.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, yes, that present.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.06,0:17:06.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She wanted to give it to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.74,0:17:10.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's been looking forward to your\Nreturn for quite some time now.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.00,0:17:12.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Doc, what is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.40,0:17:24.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll say it one more\Ntime, I didn't kill him.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.32,0:17:27.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shut up, you're a killer\Nand a liar, Outsider!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.64,0:17:30.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're serious, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.74,0:17:32.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You really want to fight me, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.22,0:17:39.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, what are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.22,0:17:44.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Joseph! Move it!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.74,0:17:55.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You did this, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.80,0:17:57.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Back off now, Brad.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.38,0:18:01.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You couldn't possibly survive a\Nfight against this breed of bad guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.02,0:18:09.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The warm-out fight, I presume?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.36,0:18:12.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, so you know my name.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.12,0:18:14.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I must say I mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.12,0:18:18.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid we've never met,\Nbut I have heard of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.28,0:18:19.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,An interesting reputation.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.24,0:18:24.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You are the man who rings the black\Nfuneral bell, chapel... Don't say it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.72,0:18:26.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Enough with your butts!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.44,0:18:39.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is just a warm-up,\Nboth for him and for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.84,0:18:42.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You are smart, Preacher.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.08,0:18:46.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It would be easy to destroy you at\Nthis point, but that would be boring.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.36,0:18:49.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To make the game more\Ninteresting, I've added a sweet L.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.78,0:18:51.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jessica!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.12,0:18:55.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have been watching you through\Nhis eyes the entire time.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.04,0:18:59.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know that you have very strong\Nfeelings for this young lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.58,0:19:00.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Very touching.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.76,0:19:03.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You do know what I have\Nin mind, do you not?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.96,0:19:10.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You pacifistic fool, don't\Nyou realize this is a trap?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.32,0:19:12.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know what it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.64,0:19:15.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then lower your piece.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.48,0:19:16.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.64,0:19:19.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just don't see any way\Nout of this damn situation!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.34,0:19:22.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There is another way.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.22,0:19:27.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we simply ignore the girl's plight,\Nwe'll definitely make it through.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.22,0:19:30.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What did you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.52,0:19:33.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think that's the best\Noption at this point in time.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.18,0:19:36.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the only logical way any\Nof us will survive against them.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.36,0:19:37.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, you can't!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.04,0:19:38.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,However,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.95,0:19:41.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I do know of a guy who whines,\Ncries, and throws tantrums,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.00,0:19:45.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and he somehow manages to\Nfind a way to save everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.92,0:19:48.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's a crazy man who's\Nnot afraid of anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.80,0:19:52.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even though he's been scarred from\Nhead to toe, he'll always be there.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.34,0:20:07.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jessica!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.25,0:20:08.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jess, are you alright?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.17,0:20:09.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They didn't hurt you, did they?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.48,0:20:10.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess they didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.86,0:20:12.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What took you so long?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.08,0:20:28.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A flower.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.34,0:20:29.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A red flower.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.72,0:20:30.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Isn't it beautiful?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.14,0:20:32.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They call this one a geranium.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.50,0:20:35.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There are many other\Ntypes of flowers on Earth
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.48,0:20:37.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,of all different colors\Nand shapes and sizes.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.92,0:20:40.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They hold a very special\Nplace in people's hearts.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.80,0:20:42.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can you eat them forever?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.72,0:20:44.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Some flowers can be eating.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.82,0:20:46.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you like flowers?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.44,0:20:49.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I love flowers, especially red ones.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.30,0:20:51.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know, they can be very symbolic.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.62,0:20:56.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even the tiniest flowers which brave the\Nelements behold a magnificent strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.52,0:20:58.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And Vash,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.00,0:21:05.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,in the language of the flower, red geraniums\Nrepresent determination and courage.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.26,0:21:19.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, wait a sec!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.74,0:21:21.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where'd you get the red coat?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.34,0:21:22.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't believe it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.96,0:21:24.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's Vash the Stampede!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.54,0:21:31.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, Vash! Vash! Vash!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.48,0:21:32.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm so scared!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.20,0:21:34.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Knock it off!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.60,0:21:36.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, will you stop it?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.44,0:21:37.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're not upset, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.30,0:21:41.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You act like it's all over.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.52,0:21:45.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But let me assure you, some of\Nmy children are still there.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.92,0:21:51.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Besides, did you really think that the\Ngung-ho guns only come to call one at a time?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.52,0:21:52.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.90,0:22:08.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Three of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.84,0:22:11.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That is correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.38,0:22:13.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have sent three demons.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.18,0:22:18.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They have arrived and will be\Nvisiting you very soon. Welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.54,0:22:22.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is your big comeback\Ncelebration... ...Vash the Stampede.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.78,0:22:50.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The blue sky in the middle of\Nthe sky, the wind is the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.98,0:22:55.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The light of the day, in the sky,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.86,0:22:58.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the light of the day?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.02,0:23:00.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.70,0:23:07.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.34,0:23:27.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.28,0:23:29.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,much for watching.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.02,0:23:46.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.62,0:23:49.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,next time.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.18,0:24:11.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's something you can't give up.\NThere's something you want to protect.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.58,0:24:16.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's a time you must take a stand,\Nno matter what kind of pain awaits us.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.48,0:24:20.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The man clad in the red coat\Ntook up his gun once again,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.64,0:24:22.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,in order to stop the sadness,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.40,0:24:25.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,in order to stop the hate.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.14,0:24:30.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I keep the word of the red geranium,\Nwhich I was taught so long ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.64,0:24:34.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I keep the courage and\Ndetermination deep in my heart.

